## Quy trinh sync moi lan doi migration

1. Tao V{n}__*.sql.
2. Tra bang tren -> list file docs bi anh huong.
3. grep noi dung lien quan trong tung file docs.
4. Liet ke diff can sua (KHONG sua ngay).
5. Bao user list file + diff preview.
6. User duyet -> moi sua docs.
7. Commit code + docs trong CUNG PR.
   - Uu tien: 1 commit "feat: ..." + 1 commit "docs: sync ...".
   - Co the gop 1 commit neu thay doi nho.
8. Cap nhat PR description theo checklist docs-sync.mdc.

## Anti-pattern

- Sua migration + implement code NHUNG quen update docs.
- Tao migration moi, hoi user "co can update docs khong?" - **PHAI** chu dong de xuat dua tren bang tren.
- Sua docs ma khong reference code hien tai.
- Commit docs rieng nhieu ngay sau commit code.
- Copy-paste JSON example cu (vd co imageUrl cu) khi da migrate sang images (V3/V4).
- Sua docs/ khong bao user -> vi pham source-of-truth.mdc.

